      "title_type": 1,
      "description": "Dear, welcome to vbestlife\nWe finally ushered in the super promotion! ! \n【OFFER】: FREE SHIPPING！\n【Special Coupon】: 5--10%OFF\n【More In】 \"Buy 2 items enjoy 3% off\" \nFollow our shop and note the gift to get a small gift\n We will ship as soon as possible\n Storewide coupons! Please check in store \nSave more, I wish you a happy shopping! !\nDon't miss our High Quality products\nIf you have any questions, please contact me~~~\n1. CIRCLE CUTTING: This cutter can cut diameter 3.1 to 12.6in circle, and it can be cut radius adjustable to meet your needs of a variety of DIY craft needs.\n2. USE SCENARIO: This simple design paper cutter is suitable for various scenes of craft DIY, office, kindergarten, school, etc. It is suitable for paper cutting enthusiasts.\n3. MULTI PURPOSE: Card paper cutting tool can be used to cut printing paper, photo paper, laminated paper, kraft paper, special paper, optical film, etc.\n4. PORTABLE DESIGN: This paper cutter is small, light weight, and with a simple portable design, you can carry it around and cut things for you anytime, anywhere.\n5. HOW TO USE: Adjust the radius of the floating knob, turn clockwise to the right and lock it tightly. Remove the protective snap cover on the bottom cutter head. Press the circular cutter firmly onto the paper to be cut. Slide the knob or handle for one cycle to finish cutting.\n\nSpecification:\nItem Type: Circular Paper Trimmer\nProduct Material: PP plastic\nProduct Function: Cut circle\n\nPackage List:\n1 x Paper Cutter\n2 x Spare Triangle Knife\n\nNote:\n1. The blade is incisive, use with care!\n2. The use of paper cutter need to be used with the pad, otherwise it will scratch the desktop.\n\n",
